### ANTI-SANITIZATION

FORBIDDEN IN EXPLICIT CONTENT unless it would be in character for characters attending to do:
- Cleaning fluids mid-scene
- Eloquent speech while throat-full or cocked-stupid
- Romantic soft-focus once skin meets skin
